FEATURES=[('Machines and sound: Six stock engines plus Sample Wizard, SD Vintage, Clap Vintage, SY Toy, SY Bits, Swarm LITE, MACRO, ACID, WAVE, Feral by Glycinate, Elder, TINY, Shadow, SPEAK and MIDI Out. Elder is an original synth inspired by Junior by Fors. Machine browsing retains synth values; Wizard’s four dials stay separate while MACHINES stays open.', 'Machines et son : Six moteurs stock plus Sample Wizard, SD Vintage, Clap Vintage, SY Toy, SY Bits, Swarm LITE, MACRO, ACID, WAVE, Feral de Glycinate, Elder, TINY, Shadow, SPEAK et MIDI Out. Elder est inspiré de Junior de Fors. La selection conserve les valeurs synth ; quatre commandes Wizard separees tant que MACHINES reste ouvert.'), ('Performance and sequencing: Arpeggiator, held-note octave 0, ChordKeys and harmony locks, Sequence Genie, SCRAMBLE, slides, trig preview, Step Recorder, latching mute and solo.', 'Performance et séquenceur : Arpège, octave 0 sur notes tenues, ChordKeys et locks d’harmonie, Sequence Genie, SCRAMBLE, slides, préécoute de pas, Step Recorder, mute verrouillé et solo.'), ('Filters and effects: Polivoks-style track/Wizard filters, second LFO, MACRO Fine/Lo-Fi; PS1, Vinyl, Reverb and Chorus 1/2; Ping Pong, Delay and Crush 1/2. Opaque FX menus apply on TRACK release. Cumulative PS1/filter optimizations. Both Shimmers and all combined modes are removed.', 'Filtres et effets : Filtres pistes/Wizard inspires Polivoks, second LFO, MACRO Fine/Lo-Fi ; PS1, Vinyl, Reverb et Chorus 1/2 ; Ping Pong, Delay et Crush 1/2. Menus opaques appliques au relachement TRACK. Optimisations PS1/filtre cumulees. Les deux Shimmer et tous les modes combines sont retires.'), ('Routing and workflow: MIDI Out with nine CC knobs, locks and two MIDI LFOs; MIDI OUT/THRU toggle; USB stereo or six tracks; permanent quick save, saved Mod Setup and optional DX diagnostics.', 'Routage et travail : MIDI Out avec neuf CC, locks et deux LFO MIDI ; bascule OUT/THRU ; USB stéréo ou six pistes ; sauvegarde permanente, Mod Setup sauvegardé et diagnostic DX facultatif.'), ('Select SPEAK: MACHINES: after Shadow, immediately before MIDI Out. Original 128-word formant speech engine. Microphone icon; CLASS VOICE / STYLE TALK / STR 1, DEX 5, MAG 5. Softer consonants and calibrated output: start around Vol+Dist 60 with Punch off.', 'Choisir SPEAK : MACHINES : apres Shadow, juste avant MIDI Out. Moteur vocal original a formants, 128 mots anglais. Icone microphone ; CLASS VOICE / STYLE TALK / STR 1, DEX 5, MAG 5. Consonnes adoucies, niveau calibre : commencer vers Vol+Dist 60, Punch coupe.'), ('Voice / Word / Speed / Articulation: COLOR / SHAPE / SWEEP / CONTOUR. Voice/formant character / Word 0-127 / Speed (64 normal, lower slower) / Articulation. SHAPE popup shows the word and index. Word changes latch at the next trig; the other three controls remain live.', 'Voice / Word / Speed / Articulation : COLOR / SHAPE / SWEEP / CONTOUR. Caractere vocal/formants / Word 0-127 / Speed (64 normal, plus bas plus lent) / Articulation. SHAPE affiche mot et index. Mot pris au prochain trig ; autres commandes en direct.'), ('Pitch and envelope: PITCH / notes; DECAY, Fine, Punch, Gate, Attack. Pitch changes independently of word speed. Begin with Decay 127 to hear complete words. Existing filters and FX sends apply. Each track has its own speech state.', 'Hauteur et enveloppe : PITCH / notes ; DECAY, Fine, Punch, Gate, Attack. Hauteur independante de la vitesse. Commencer a Decay 127 pour les mots complets. Filtres et sends existants disponibles. Etat vocal distinct par piste.'), ('Word sequences and modulation: Hold a trig + SHAPE, then lock Pitch and other knobs normally. Word and other native parameters support p-locks and LFO destinations. COLOR/SHAPE/SWEEP/CONTOUR use MIDI CC 16/17/18/19. Leave space for the word or increase Speed.', 'Sequences de mots et modulation : Maintenir TRIG + SHAPE, puis locks Pitch et autres commandes. Mot et autres parametres natifs acceptent p-locks et destinations LFO. COLOR/SHAPE/SWEEP/CONTOUR : MIDI CC 16/17/18/19. Espacer les mots ou augmenter Speed.'), ('Example sentence: SHAPE words and note locks on successive trigs. HELLO 31, I 0, AM 62, A 17, ROBOT 113, I 0, LOVE 35, MUSIC 106. Full indexed word library follows at the end of this guide.', 'Exemple de phrase : Mots SHAPE et locks de notes sur des trigs successifs. HELLO 31, I 0, AM 62, A 17, ROBOT 113, I 0, LOVE 35, MUSIC 106. Lexique complet indexe a la fin du guide.'), ('Reverb-slot menu: Hold TRACK + REVERB SIZE. Top to bottom: PS1, VINYL, REVERB, CHORUS 1, CHORUS 2. Turn left to move up, right to move down. Browse without changing sound; release TRACK to apply, BACK to cancel.', 'Menu reverb : Maintenir TRACK + REVERB SIZE. De haut en bas : PS1, VINYL, REVERB, CHORUS 1, CHORUS 2. Gauche monte, droite descend. Son inchange pendant le parcours ; relacher TRACK applique, BACK annule.'), ('Delay-slot menu: Hold TRACK + DELAY TIME. Top to bottom: PING PONG, DELAY, CRUSH 1, CRUSH 2. From DELAY, left/up selects Ping Pong; right/down selects Crush 1 then Crush 2. Release TRACK to apply; BACK cancels.', 'Menu delay : Maintenir TRACK + DELAY TIME. De haut en bas : PING PONG, DELAY, CRUSH 1, CRUSH 2. Depuis DELAY, gauche/haut vers Ping Pong ; droite/bas vers Crush 1 puis Crush 2. Relacher TRACK applique ; BACK annule.'), ('DX: With DX On: tap FUNC, press FUNC again within 350 ms, hold at least 0.5 seconds, then release. Other controls cancel the gesture. Shows/resets A/P/O/N: average/peak CPU load, overruns, governor voice drops. Replaces the old shortcut; retrig latching never triggers it. Off by default.', 'DX : DX On : appui bref FUNC, second appui sous 350 ms, maintien au moins 0,5 seconde puis relacher. Toute autre commande annule. Affiche/remet a zero A/P/O/N : charge moyenne/pic, overruns, voix coupees par le gouverneur. Remplace ancien raccourci ; verrou retrig sans diagnostic. Off par defaut.'), ('SCRAMBLE: deleting a marked trig clears its mark and locks; replacements start clean.', 'SCRAMBLE : supprimer un trig marque retire marque et locks ; les nouveaux trigs repartent propres.')]

def render_features():
 # Texte approuve par AveyCole, commun au generateur et a la page principale.
 listing='<div class="fixed-features"><h3><span data-l="en">Included features</span><span data-l="fr">Fonctions incluses</span></h3><ul>'
 listing+=''.join('<li><span data-l="en">'+en+'</span><span data-l="fr">'+fr+'</span></li>' for en,fr in FEATURES)
 listing+='</ul><p><strong><span data-l="en">AND MORE!</span><span data-l="fr">ET BIEN PLUS !</span></strong></p>'
 listing+='<p><a href="release-notes-2.31.html"><span data-l="en">Full release notes</span><span data-l="fr">Notes de version completes</span></a></p>'
 listing+='<a href="#step-file"><span data-l="en">Continue: load OS files</span><span data-l="fr">Continuer : charger les OS</span></a></div>'
 return listing

